--------------------------------
masked_select_out_cuda_impl
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/IndexKernel.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    masked_select_out_cuda_impl(
        result: Tensor[?, dtype],
        self: Tensor[*D, dtype],
        mask: Tensor[*D, bool]
    ) -> Tensor[?, dtype]

    约束:
    - self.dtype == result.dtype
    - mask.dtype == bool

【算法】
    # Step 1: 处理0维tensor (转为1维)
    if mask.dim == 0:
        mask_temp = mask.unsqueeze(0)
    else:
        mask_temp = mask

    if self.dim == 0:
        self_temp = self.unsqueeze(0)
    else:
        self_temp = self

    # Step 2: 广播到相同形状
    mask_expanded, self_expanded = expand_outplace(mask_temp, self_temp)

    # Step 3: 执行索引操作
    at::cuda::index_out(result, self_expanded, [mask_expanded])

    return result

【备注】
    - index_out: 内部调用的高级索引函数
    - expand_outplace: 返回可能是borrowed或owned的tensor

