masked_scatter__cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/IndexKernel.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    masked_scatter__cuda(
        self: Tensor[*D, dtype],
        mask: Tensor[*D, bool],
        source: Tensor[S, dtype]
    ) -> Tensor[*D, dtype]

    约束:
    - self.dtype == source.dtype
    - mask.dtype == bool
    - sum(mask) <= source.numel

【算法】
    # Step 1: 验证与广播
    at::assert_no_internal_overlap(self)
    b_mask = expand_inplace(self, mask)

    if self.numel == 0:
        return self

    # Step 2: 计算前缀和并执行scatter
    maskPrefixSum = at::empty(self.sizes(), dtype=int64, device=mask.device)
    launch_masked_scatter_kernel(self, b_mask, maskPrefixSum, source)

    return self

【备注】
    - expand_inplace: 将mask广播到self的形状
    - launch_masked_scatter_kernel: 定义在IndexKernel.cu中

