launch_masked_scatter_kernel (header declaration)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/IndexKernel.h
--------------------------------

【签名】
    launch_masked_scatter_kernel(
        self: TensorBase,
        mask: TensorBase,
        maskPrefixSum: TensorBase [in,out],
        source: TensorBase
    )

【备注】
    - 函数声明，实现在IndexKernel.cu
